        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>《沁园春·雪》赏析 - 题目解析</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #e9e9e9;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .page-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .screen {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 380px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #444;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 10px 14px 60px 14px;\n  }\n  .doc-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .question {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .option-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n  }\n  .option-row.selected {\n    background: #eaf3ff;\n  }\n  .option-label {\n    flex: 0 0 22px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    color: #666;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n  }\n  .option-row.selected .option-label {\n    background: #4a90e2;\n    border-color: #4a90e2;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .option-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: justify;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .option-row.selected .option-text {\n    color: #2a6fc9;\n  }\n  .answer-block {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #ddd;\n  }\n  .answer-header {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #fff3cd;\n    color: #b9860a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 2px 10px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .correct-answer {\n    color: #e07b00;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .analysis-text {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .section-label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55%;\n    left: 5%;\n    width: 90%;\n    color: #ff8fb0;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    opacity: 0.75;\n    transform: rotate(-18deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n  .watermark.right {\n    top: 45%;\n    font-size: 26px;\n  }\n  .bottombar {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    margin: 0 4px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .btn.prev {\n    background: #eee;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .btn.next {\n    background: #ffb300;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-wrap\">\n\n  <!-- LEFT SCREEN -->\n  <div class=\"screen\">\n    <div class=\"topbar\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\">‹</span>\n      <span>1 / 4</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"doc-title\">《沁园春·雪》</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        1.（2018秋•南开区期末）下面对《沁园春雪》的赏析，不恰当的一项是（&nbsp;&nbsp;）\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">A</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          沁园春•雪 毛泽东 北国风光，千里冰封，万里雪飘。望长城内外，惟余莽莽；大河上下，顿失滔滔。山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象，欲与天公试比高。须晴日，看红装素裹，分外妖娆。江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。惜秦皇汉武，略输文采；唐宗宋祖，稍逊风骚。一代天骄，成吉思汗，只识弯弓射大雕。俱往矣，数风流人物，还看今朝。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">B</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          \"惟余莽莽\"顿失滔滔\"分别照应\"雪飘\"分别照应\"雪飘\"，强化了自然万物的壮观景象。\"惜\"字二字，则写出变化之迅速，惊心之壮观，让人联想到未冰封时大河滔滔的雄壮气势。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row selected\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">C</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象\"是静态描写，都有活泼奔放的气势。加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，就联想到一种奋发的态势和竞争的活力。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">D</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          \"江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。\"这两句是文章展开与下文议论之间的过渡，\"北国风光[?]多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。承上总括上片的写景，展开对历\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"watermark\">\n        微课后还有经典考题<br>\n        快来检查自己学的咋样\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottombar\">\n      <div class=\"btn prev\">上一题</div>\n      <div class=\"btn next\">下一题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RIGHT SCREEN -->\n  <div class=\"screen\">\n    <div class=\"topbar\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\">‹</span>\n      <span>1 / 4</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        使人联想到未冰封时大河滔滔的雄壮气势。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row selected\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">C</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          \"山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象\"是静态描写，都有活泼奔放的气势。加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，就联想到一种奋发的态势和竞争的活力。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option-row\">\n        <div class=\"option-label\">D</div>\n        <div class=\"option-text\">\n          \"江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。\"这两句是文章展开与下文议论之间的过渡，\"北国风光\"多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。承上总括上片的写景，展开对历代英雄的评论，抒发诗人的感情。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"answer-block\">\n        <span class=\"answer-header\">解答：</span>\n        <div class=\"correct-answer\">正确答案：C</div>\n        <div class=\"analysis-text\">\n          ABD. 正确：C. 有误，\"山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象\"的动态描写，有一种活泼奔放的气势，加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，\"山\"\"原\"与天相连，更增添了奋发的态势和竞争的活力。故选：C。\n        </div>\n\n        <span class=\"section-label\">考点：</span>\n        <div class=\"analysis-text\">诗歌阅读综合</div>\n\n        <span class=\"section-label\">分析：</span>\n        <div class=\"analysis-text\">\n          本题考查学生诗歌关键语句的理解，注意结合全诗内容深入分析思想感情。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"watermark right\">\n        解析hin详细！\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottombar\">\n      <div class=\"btn prev\">上一题</div>\n      <div class=\"btn next\">下一题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
